  "[color=#E9DFC1]Reduces [color=#FFD16D]all[/color] damage taken by a flat amount equal to the [color=#FFD16D]Armour value[/color].[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]This is the [color=#FFD16D]final[/color] damage calculation step.[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1][color=#FFD16D]Armour can be broken[/color] by dealing a hit [color=#FFD16D]equal to or higher[/color] than the Armour value.[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]Base Bonus XP granted per Kill:[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Hitpoints:[/color] [color=#26D345]{1:N0}[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Other:[/color] [color=#26D345]{0:N0}[/color] [color=#E9DFC1](Allocated based on your Stance)[/color]": "[color=#E9DFC1]按[color=#FFD16D]护甲值[/color]固定减免[color=#FFD16D]所有[/color]受到的伤害。[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]这是伤害计算的[color=#FFD16D]最后一步[/color]。[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]造成[color=#FFD16D]大于或等于[/color]护甲值的单次伤害即可[color=#FFD16D]击破护甲[/color]。[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]每次击杀的基础额外经验：[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]生命值：[/color] [color=#26D345]{1:N0}[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]其他：[/color] [color=#26D345]{0:N0}[/color] [color=#E9DFC1]（根据姿态分配）[/color]",
  "[color=#E9DFC1]Reduces [color=#FFD16D]all[/color] damage taken by a flat amount equal to the [color=#FFD16D]Armour value[/color].[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]This is the [color=#FFD16D]final[/color] damage calculation step.[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]Your [color=#FFD16D]Armour will break[/color] if the Enemy deals a hit [color=#FFD16D]equal to or higher[/color] than your Armour value.[/color]": "[color=#E9DFC1]按[color=#FFD16D]护甲值[/color]固定减免[color=#FFD16D]所有[/color]受到的伤害。[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]这是伤害计算的[color=#FFD16D]最后一步[/color]。[/color]\n\n[color=#E9DFC1]敌人单次伤害[color=#FFD16D]大于或等于[/color]护甲值时，[color=#FFD16D]护甲会破碎[/color]。[/color]",
